# Cloudflare Pages headers. See docs/RUNBOOK.md for the reasoning.
#
# The service worker (Workbox, generated at build time into sw.js/workbox-*.js)
# owns app-shell freshness via content-hashed precache entries; the CDN's job
# is to get out of its way, not add a second opinion about what's fresh:
#   - index.html and the SW's own files must be revalidated on every request,
#     or a stale edge copy can pin clients to an old app version indefinitely
#     (a new SW is only discovered by re-fetching sw.js).
#   - /data/program.min.json is fetched at runtime by src/data/load.ts, which
#     already does its own cache-then-revalidate with `cache: 'no-cache'`
#     (forces a real conditional request past the browser's HTTP cache). A
#     long-lived edge cache in front of that would silently defeat the
#     revalidation during the daily data refresh.
#   - Hashed build assets under /assets/* never change contents for a given
#     filename, so they're safe to cache forever.
#
# Every app route below (/search, /paper/*, /schedule, ...) is served as
# index.html content via the _redirects 200 rewrite. Cloudflare's docs do not
# say whether _headers matching happens against the original request path or
# the rewritten destination, and that is not something we can resolve without
# deploying. If it's unresolved and left to the catch-all `/*` below (which
# sets no Cache-Control at all), a visitor who lands directly on a deep link
# like /paper/M-PM-001 could get pinned to a cached index.html for the whole
# conference, never picking up a data refresh. So every known route prefix
# gets its own explicit no-cache rule here, redundantly with / and
# /index.html: if Cloudflare matches pre-rewrite, these are what cover it; if
# it matches post-rewrite, they're harmless duplicates of the /index.html
# rule. Either way the ambiguity stops being able to matter. Add a line here
# for any new top-level route added to src/App.tsx.

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/search
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/paper/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/author/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/affiliation/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/session/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/schedule
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/satellite
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/satellite/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/calendar
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/import
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/about
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/registerSW.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/workbox-*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/data/program.min.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
